</div></div></div><div class="fe-block fe-block-a597a59e31d735fa0e28"><div class="sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block sqs-background-enabled" data-block-css="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/51f8b177-e779-41f7-a632-53f2040db8df_804/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]" data-block-scripts="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/51f8b177-e779-41f7-a632-53f2040db8df_804/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]" data-block-type="1337" data-definition-name="website.components.html" data-sqsp-block="text" data-website-component-id="a597a59e31d735fa0e28" id="block-a597a59e31d735fa0e28"><div class="sqs-block-content"><div class="sqs-text-block-container">
  
  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h4 style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><span class="sqsrte-text-color--custom" style="color: #0A3C8A;">Eligibility Requirements</span></h4><ul data-rte-list="default"><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><span class="sqsrte-text-color--black">Venture or private equity-backed and not publicly traded, nor filed to IPO</span></p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><span class="sqsrte-text-color--black">Not acquired by a publicly traded company</span></p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><span class="sqsrte-text-color--black">Clear dual-use or defense applicability with relevance to U.S. national security</span></p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><span class="sqsrte-text-color--black">At least one U.S. government contract secured as of December 31, 2025</span></p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><span class="sqsrte-text-color--black">Cleared vetting for foreign ownership, control, or influence (FOCI) concerns</span></p></li></ul></div>


  
